:: Bathroom Scoop Out Vagina
<<effects>><<set _exit to $bathroomExit or "Bathroom">>
<<if wornSetupClothes("lower").skirt>>
	Raising your $worn.lower.name,
<<elseif $worn.lower.name isnot "naked">>
	<<lowerstrip>>
	Lowering your $worn.lower.name,
<<else>>
	Reaching to your nethers,
<</if>>
<<if $worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked">>
	<<underlowerstrip>>
	you drop your $worn.under_lower.name in one swift motion. The stickiness on your $worn.under_lower.name_simple leaves a strand of fluid leading back to your <<pussy>> as it parts away.
<<else>>
	you brush your hand along your <<pussy>>, noticing a strand of fluid sticking to your hand.
<</if>>
<<if playerHasWornVaginalDildo()>>
	<<set _toyName to $worn.vaginal_dildo.name>><<set $worn.vaginal_dildo.state to "removed">>
	You carefully pull your _toyName from your vagina and set it aside.
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<arousal 200 "vagina">>
With some effort, you spread your vagina, digging into its depths, and manage to scoop out the gunk inside you.<<wash_vagina>>
<<if _toyName>>
	You then slide your _toyName back into your vagina.<<vaginaldildoon>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<if $pleasure gte $pleasuremax>>
	However, the stimulation from digging between your folds proves too intense, pushing you over the edge.
	<<orgasm>>
	<br><br>
<</if>>
<<link [[Next|_exit]]>><<clotheson>><<run delete $bathroomExit>><</link>>
<br>

